.State.RELEASED)\n```\n\n---\n\nThat's all 12 files — the 6 specifically named files plus all 6 additional `.gd` files found in `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/`.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f21568443ffejNG82LO1rQTXo7","sessionId":"ses_f2155f9bcffeqeaFu9hHmTUcI3","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore card UI files","time":{"start":1790442079813,"end":1790442197955}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_bfc75ca5-dfae-44e2-a7e9-eeafa6ea2a17"}},"id":"prt_0deaa063e001qDrpX6vYFHltBj","sessionID":"ses_f21568443ffejNG82LO1rQTXo7","messageID":"msg_0dea9b942001NZlOkBszyKJcY9"}}
